<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the Pan Pacific Open women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 5-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>8-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat 3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-1 6-0</p>
<p>4-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 6-3 4-6 6-2.</p>
</text>
